  "title": "How an optical fibre guides light",
  "description": "A core with a higher refractive index than its cladding can guide light by total internal reflection; the external coating has a protective role. Orthographic end and side views on a restrained blueprint grid, precise ray geometry and a normal at the point of reflection.",
